{{知识点名称}}一、Market Organization and Structure{{知识点内容}}Market types: exchange, OTC；Order types: market, limit, stop；Market efficiency: weak, semi-strong, strong▮{{知识点名称}}二、Security Market Indices{{知识点内容}}Price-weighted, market-cap-weighted, equal-weighted；Rebalancing and reconstitution▮{{知识点名称}}三、Equity Valuation{{知识点内容}}DDM (Dividend Discount Model)；Gordon Growth Model: P₀ = D₁ / (r - g)；Two-stage DDM；Free Cash Flow Models；FCFF, FCFE；Market-based Valuation；P/E, P/B, P/S, EV/EBITDA▮{{知识点名称}}四、Industry and Company Analysis{{知识点内容}}Industry life cycle；Porter's Five Forces；Competitive advantages▮{{知识点名称}}2025 Updates{{知识点内容}}New content on digital economy valuations；Updated ESG integration in equity analysis▮{{知识点名称}}Exam Tips{{知识点内容}}High-frequency topics: DDM, P/E ratio, market efficiency；Weight: 10-12% of exam▮{{知识点名称}}Common Mistakes{{知识点内容}}⚠️ Gordon Growth Model assumes constant growth forever；⚠️ Trailing P/E vs leading P/E；⚠️ Market-cap-weighted indices have momentum bias